juebot development bundle
Package: @local/dsh-juebot
Version: 0.1.0-dev.2

Scope and status
----------------
This bundle provides a native read-only console and activation-time Host
in-memory diagnostics, not a connected chat bot or an editable setup page.
The patch inserts the active juebot-console and the separate disabled
juebot-host storage backend with storagePath:null. No preset or existing
third-party row is overridden. No persistent database, QQ/model connection,
Code execution, background polling or administrative write action is started
by the console. Native Host and Client verification must be reported separately
from local tests and this metadata; visual acceptance is not implied.

Compatibility declaration
-------------------------
The manifest targets DSH 0.2.1-rc.3 exactly.
Node >=22.18.0 is a declared requirement, not a claim that every matching
Node version has been tested. Runtime and integration evidence must be
reported separately from this declaration.
No dependencies or package lifecycle scripts are declared.

Artwork provenance
------------------
icon.svg is original artwork created specifically for juebot in this
metadata round: a robot-shaped speech bubble and a memory-chip antenna,
constructed from basic SVG geometry. It incorporates no third-party artwork,
fonts, remote images, linked resources, or scripts.
XML parsing and static resource checks do not prove rendering in the DSH UI.
